+%% Abstract forms for module Mod, without compiling them to BEAM and without
+%% touching the function store.  Calls between the defuns in ToplevelDefs
+%% resolve to Mod, as they will once load/2 registers them.  kl_tle/0 runs the
+%% non-defun toplevel forms in order and returns the last one's value, or
